c(36, "§7.1 table (verbatim); §7.1; §7.2 table (verbatim); §7.2; §7.3 table (verbatim); §7.3", "timeline", "Eras are release dates (verbatim): " + table("## 7.1 Method", 0) + " || by month (verbatim): " + table("## 7.2 Volume and language", 0) + " — volume rises after 1.0.9 'Added languages' (2.65 → 7.09 per 30 days; peak 10.24 in 2026-01-24 → 04-18, 18 of 29 Russian); non-English 23.1% before → 69.9% after; ratings do not move (4.77 → 4.95 → 4.97) — 'the largest change in the corpus is about who writes, not what they think'. The review prompts did not produce the rise (verbatim): " + table("## 7.3 The review prompts", 0) + " — neither prompt release is followed by a rise; the prompt alone does not explain the volume.", "localisation 1.0.9; review prompt 1.0.1/1.0.6", "praise", "E1 13 / 4.77★; E2 43 / 4.95★; E3 30 / 4.97★; post-1.0.9 rate ×2.7", "none", "table", "app-specific", ["13432837735", "12749498855"], "", "localisation, not the review prompt, moved the review rate")

