c(38, "§7.5; §7.6", "timeline", "Requests and releases: frequency requests stop after 'Smarter habit goals' (5 of 59 before 1.0.15, 0 of 27 after — consistent with the release addressing the need, nothing stronger); categories praised 21 days after 1.0.14; both Watch requests are recent (E3) and unaddressed; both date-boundary defects predate 1.0.19 'Custom week start'. The launch-period storefront cluster: six of E1's 13 reviews (46.2%) from Romania and Hungary, none after 2025-10-18, all 5★ in English, two carrying the developer's surname; consistent with a launch audience in the developer's network — 'the earliest ratings are the least independent'; excluding them E1 falls 4.77 → 4.57★ (7 reviews), corpus 4.930 → 4.925★, no share moves more than 3.8 points.", "n/a", "mixed", "REQ_FREQUENCY 5 → 0 after 1.0.15; ro/hu 6 of 13 E1; E1 ex-cluster 4.57★", "none", "limited evidence", "app-specific", ["13284638193", "13704639248", "13915639119", "13951819028", "14048929482", "12886063451", "13282170850"], "", "")

