c(40, "§8.2; part 8 #2", "must-never-break", "§8.2 immediate fix — the date-boundary and widget defects: test completion writes across the week boundary (including the new custom week start), across time zones, and from widgets specifically; confirm several widgets can each show a different habit and show how; 'the only defects that recur in type, and widgets are the most praised feature that also fails'; also the transparent-icon display and the yearly-percentage basis (one each; the second may be an option rather than a fix).", "date/time-zone boundary; widget config", "complaint", "DEF_DATE_LOGIC 2; DEF_WIDGET 1; FRICTION_WIDGET_CONFIG 1; 3 of 4 4★ name a defect", "must-never-break", "High-priority", "generalisable", ["13318616929", "13682367544", "14499109087", "13761082816", "13985196266"], "", "")

